  "note": "Lean proves (4.50) with the last term (U+1)²V log q/(2x) multiplied by 3/2, because the last step of (4.55) is false; η = η₂, c₀ = 32. Erratum: The last O*-term of (4.50) rests on sum_{p^a<=V, p|q} (log p) p^a <= V log q in (4.55), which is false (12 log 3 > 9 log 3 at q=3, V=9). (checked by `scripts/checks/eq_4_50.py`)."
